  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto has formally bestowed the status of National Hero upon nineteen prominent figures who made significant contributions to the nation's history. Among the recipients are key figures recognized for their roles in regional development and military defense, including the founder of Pekanbaru, Marhum Pekan, and the guerrilla commander Lieutenant Colonel Mochammad Sroedji. The group also includes influential religious leaders like Kiai Abbas, known as the 'Tiger from the West,' and state figures such as RM Margono and Jenderal Hoegeng. Regional leaders, including representatives from Central Java and Pekanbaru, have welcomed these honors, suggesting that the recognition serves as both a validation of historical contributions and an inspiration for younger generations to emulate the spirits of these individuals. The ceremony highlights the government's focus on historical institutional recognition during the current administration.",
